// Example of an asynchronous object macro (Ruby).

+ *
- No reply for that. Type "reply test" to test the asynchronous macro.

+ reply test
- Wait for it... <call>replyTest</call>

> object replyTest ruby
  nick = rs.current_user

  # Send a second reply after 2 seconds via the host bot's send_message.
  Thread.new do
    sleep 2
    send_message(nick, "Second reply!")
  end

  return ""
< object
